{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06477","headline":"题招隐寺绚公房 · 綦毋潜","name":"题招隐寺绚公房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开士度人久，空岩花雾深。\n徒知燕坐处，不见有爲心。\n兰若门对壑，田家路隔林。\n还言证法性，归去比黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}